# 16. Spatial simulation

Represent the pitch internally using coordinates.

For example:

```text
Pitch:
105 × 68 metres

Player:
x = 41.2
y = 29.8

Ball:
x = 43.1
y = 30.4
```

Every player has:

```text
position
velocity
orientation
stamina
role
marking target
movement target
```

This allows your engine eventually to generate a proper 2D match.

