# 17. Passing calculation

A pass success probability might incorporate:

```text
passing
technique
vision
decisions
distance
pressure
weak foot
receiver movement
opposition interception
weather
fatigue
```

Conceptually:

$$
P(pass)=σ(
Passing +
Technique +
Vision +
DecisionQuality -
DistancePenalty -
Pressure -
InterceptionRisk
)
$$

Don't use attributes directly as percentages.

**Passing = 17 does not mean 85% pass success.**

Attributes feed mathematical models.

