# 18. Shooting

A shot should generate an internal xG probability.

Inputs:

```text
distance
angle
body position
preferred foot
defensive pressure
goalkeeper position
shot type
finishing
composure
technique
fatigue
```

Example:

```text
Shot

Distance: 8.4m
Angle: excellent
Pressure: moderate
Foot: preferred

xG = 0.41
```

Then resolve the attempt.

This lets your game calculate genuine:

```text
xG
xA
shot quality
finishing performance
```

rather than fake statistics generated after the result.

