# 62. Deterministic simulation

Use seeded random generation.

Example:

```text
save_seed = 819271
match_seed = 183712
```

This makes bugs reproducible.

If someone reports:

> Game crashes during Arsenal City vs Liverpool United on 14 March 2031.

you can reproduce the simulation.

Extremely important for testing.

