passes
shots
tactics
statistics
```

### Tier B — important leagues

Simplified simulation:

```text
lineups
player ratings
events
statistics
```

### Tier C — background world

Statistical simulation:

```text
result
goals
appearances
injuries
development
```

This lets you simulate a huge world efficiently.

