# 68. Architecture I'd use

Because you already have some familiarity with Godot, I'd use:

```text
Godot 4.x
        │
        ├── UI
        │
        ├── 2D Match Renderer
        │
        └── Game Controller
                 │
                 ▼
        Simulation Core
                 │
      ┌──────────┼──────────┐
      ▼          ▼          ▼
Match Engine  World Sim  AI Manager
      │          │          │
      └──────────┼──────────┘
                 ▼
             Data Layer
                 │
              SQLite
```

The simulation should not depend on UI.

You should be able to run:

```text
