# 74. Match-engine invariants

Some events should be mathematically impossible.

Tests:

```text
Player cannot score after being substituted.

Suspended player cannot play.

Team cannot field 12 players.

Ball cannot simultaneously belong to two players.

Penalty shootout cannot end tied.

League table points must equal results.

Transfer cannot exceed available funds unless debt allowed.
```

Thousands of these rules create reliability.

