# 76. A realistic version 1.0

I'd target these systems as your commercial 1.0:

**World:** 20 countries, ~60 competitions, promotion/relegation, continental competitions, dynamic reputation and unlimited seasons.

**Players:** ~40 attributes, personalities, hidden attributes, development, aging, injuries, relationships, contracts, history and procedural youth players.

**Football:** sophisticated 2D match engine, tactical roles, formations, instructions, substitutions, fatigue, xG and genuine generated statistics.

**Management:** scouting, transfers, contracts, training, staff, finances, board objectives and facilities.

**AI:** clubs build squads according to tactics and finances; managers have careers; clubs hire/fire managers.

**History:** records, awards, past winners, club legends, player careers and manager careers.

**Technical:** SQLite, deterministic simulation, automated tests, 100-year soak tests, mod support and autosave.

That is already an enormous game.

